OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for #200m chicken
OL,4,Aprocessing plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for a #200m
OL,7,Fpoultry processing factory near
OL,8,FGrimsby.
OL,10,FThe proposed site at the Europarc
OL,11,Findustrial estate in Healing would
OL,12,Fprovide 1,400 jobs, according to its
OL,13,Fdeveloper Hull-based Cranswick Country
OL,14,FFoods PLC.
OL,16,FWhen complete, the site could process
OL,17,Fup to 1.75m chickens a week.
OL,19,FIf approved, the facility would take
OL,20,Ftwo years to build and support an
OL,21,Festimated 800 construction jobs, a
OL,22,Fspokesperson for the firm said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
